[{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十四","author":"韩氏","text":"霜冷吴江夜抖翎，烧残野火当藜青。\n雨馀神鬼连宵哭，漏静蛟鼍隔水听。\n极浦航归因草草，远湾烟霁一星星。\n云龙山下空回首，点笔山人放鹤亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十五","author":"韩氏","text":"天与云霞作剡藤，横空腕力得风增。\n潇湘清怨诗千首，罗刹晴潮墨一升。\n小住鸥波凭浩荡，几时凤阙许飞腾。\n迷离苔藓黄昏蚀，细辨碑阴月是镫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26854,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十六","author":"韩氏","text":"珍重寒衣万里投，乱砧声里断云流。\n发书有泪传青塞，罢织谁家倚翠楼。\n绣被易凉人易远，回文难学婢难偷。\n红绳足下仍牢系，妆阁归来句再酬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26855,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十七","author":"韩氏","text":"江湖兄弟并书淫，令节茱萸望远心。\n歧路分携成折股，顺风直下试悬针。\n偶鸣得意莺迁木，忽写离情鸟忆林。\n草满池塘归未遂，欲寻佳句梦中临。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26856,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十八","author":"韩氏","text":"碧落高寒兴正酣，谁将拓本寄江潭。\n水澄文荇波三折，山拭晴岚石一函。\n妙手真从天半倚，愁心全向笔端含。\n浮图顶上曾题遍，千佛名经献彩昙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26857,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其二十九","author":"韩氏","text":"白云浅处认牙签，朗朗真宜众目瞻。\n波抉晴滩初纸拂，露研春草有花黏。\n萧萧竹借凌霄管，软软沙铺对岸缣。\n全力拓开周万里，精神更聚在毫尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26858,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁字三十首次韵 其三十","author":"韩氏","text":"起草飞从弱水岩，春秋相值语呢喃。\n人家江浦花封字，使者燕关雪冻涵。\n天上图书无尺寸，世间笔札别仙凡。\n殷勤爱煞清虚符，好借轻云画素衫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26859,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏盆中松树","author":"韩氏","text":"偃蹇依然水石清，贞心独结后凋盟。\n生来不受人攀折，雪共荒寒月共明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26860,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春夜琴兴","author":"彭玉嵌","text":"杜鹃声里一镫昏，感旧思乡不可论。\n独取焦桐横膝上，夜寒弹月下花村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26861,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杪春","author":"彭玉嵌","text":"又是新篁解箨时，东风二十四番吹。\n碧纱窗展看春雨，剩有残花一两枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26862,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀梅谷客越","author":"彭玉嵌","text":"真向山阴道上游，曰归何日咏刀头。\n吴歌听彻烟江月，楚簟凉生水阁秋。\n嵊县东回难著屐，剡溪南下不通舟。\n尺书未寄寒衣薄，莫眺天边风露楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26863,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虹屏夜临欧书镫烬落成烧痕以诗志之","author":"彭玉嵌","text":"秋风瑟瑟夜悠悠，翠袖天寒尚写欧。\n忽听莺声呼可惜，镫花小烬落银钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26864,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和虹屏秋感绝句","author":"彭玉嵌","text":"秋气无端入骨苏，清愁自省亦模糊。\n丹青只有骚人手，画出伤心一片图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26865,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题临献之帖","author":"沈彩","text":"江梅几点漏春光，鹆眼新磨紫玉香。\n初试裌衣莺语里，小窗閒写《十三行》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26866,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖上次主君韵","author":"沈彩","text":"偶然临眺处，花笑鸟能吟。\n曲水流青草，遥山映碧林。\n燕来双剪冷，云去半湖阴。\n徙倚风前柳，柔情共尔深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26867,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避暑","author":"沈彩","text":"避暑北窗下，凉风吹幽襟。\n蕉竹夹深翠，仲夏如秋阴。\n残花犹未尽，寒蝉已先吟。\n芳兰供一缶，石上陈清琴。\n欲按山水调，纤爪力不任。\n但取横膝上，一寄飞仙心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26868,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜读","author":"沈彩","text":"被服纨与绮，流览圣与儒。\n岂为荣名计，简编自堪娱。\n栖乌中夜起，明月临前除。\n皓皓清露冷，萧萧竹影疏。\n我思英皇女，千载不得俱。\n复观曹大家，八志《续汉书》。\n伊余慕前淑，汲古期有馀。\n譬如月桂影，而欲穷根株。\n终当事蚕织，私好徒区区。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26869,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日薄游","author":"沈彩","text":"不须绣幕逐香车，小径春明玩物华。\n罨画溪添三尺水，催诗雨送一枝花。\n离离青草终无尽，的的红颜信有涯。\n准拟明朝钻活火，太湖石上试新茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26870,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀梅谷主君客越同夫人韵","author":"沈彩","text":"为访灵威烂漫游，潇潇暮雨越溪头。\n已凋蒲柳千螺翠，未老芙蓉一镜秋。\n明月双湾无到雁，浙江三折阻归舟。\n不堪南望增惆怅，凉笛声中独倚楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26871,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次主君戏赠韵","author":"沈彩","text":"大海珊瑚折一枝，镂成彩笔寄吟诗。\n临池上拟岐阳鼓，敲句坚须博浪锤。\n苦爱蠹书成脉望，不知霞脸去春肢。\n外孙荠日终何用，欲叩天阍一问之。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26872,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓起作书因题","author":"沈彩","text":"晓起弄笔札，白露进窗几。\n虽嫌皓腕冷，滋润亦可喜。\n欲书青李帖，拂拭苔花纸。\n漏痕无成心，折钗有妙理。\n悠悠千载下，可能入米史。\n鬓丝帘影间，染翰聊记此。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26873,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初秋","author":"沈彩","text":"佛桑花底坐凉飔，正是幽闺七月时。\n作画应知特健药，镌书须倩伏灵芝。\n甘回齿颊梨拳破，碧照衣襟竹个垂。\n欲寄美人摇落思，芭蕉和露写新诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26874,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清秋临眺","author":"沈彩","text":"清秋如静女，窈窕不多妆。\n菱浦微弯月，枫林小著霜。\n山眉修入画，波縠滑生光。\n更拟褰裳去，三湘畹芷香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26875,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与夫人论诗偶成","author":"沈彩","text":"羚羊挂角处，无迹少人知。\n偶尔成佳句，泊然何所思。\n从来兰似草，莫认菌为芝。\n微雨空闺里，茶香细论诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26876,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜书兴","author":"沈彩","text":"绣床书轴斗精严，寂坐红闺夜已淹。\n山子数声如咒月，风姨一笑正褰帘。\n椒兰无气香将烬，巾舄生潮露暗沾。\n拟把簪花三寸管，尽收清景入毫尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26877,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初寒","author":"沈彩","text":"残菊犹存一两丫，清霜淡驻画檐牙。\n蝶惊年冷难依草，蝇恋微温易入茶。\n呵镜白云初滴雨，卷帘红叶故如花。\n晓来不觉肌生粟，半臂妆成换縠纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26878,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答邻姝","author":"沈彩","text":"长啸月当窗，微吟日卓午。\n邻姝谓余曰，读书徒自苦。\n多谢邻姝言，余心慕终古。\n譬如蜂酿蜜，性命藉为主。\n千函敌百城，万事轻一羽。\n但愿长如此，来生仍女姥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26879,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日閒适","author":"沈彩","text":"閒铺翠毯拂云笺，血玉蛟螭镇一圈。\n春日花多栽句易，雨窗砚润作书便。\n将临大令鹅群帖，拟赋庄生蝶梦篇。\n不觉钟鸣时向午，隔溪修竹上厨烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26880,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚兴","author":"沈彩","text":"雕栏品亚倦馀凭，爱绘青春藻思仍。\n小苑杏花三月雨，高楼藜火十年镫。\n閒情已入无何有，好句常来得未曾。\n便拟下帘重展卷，乌丝淡墨写溪藤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26881,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古诗二首寄采芝山人 其一","author":"沈彩","text":"山人烟霞心，笔墨师董巨。\n独立千仞冈，啸傲绝俦侣。\n貌山粉本收，得句锦囊贮。\n曾上娥眉峰，或泊鸳鸯渚。\n清川泛长薄，落日淡容与。\n依依陇首云，冥冥花间雨。\n江海空青苍，采芝在何处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26882,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古诗二首寄采芝山人 其二","author":"沈彩","text":"我本青云侣，失足堕尘寰。\n飘飖鸾凤群，逸兴不可删。\n拾翠弄菀茝，采香佩兰蕳。\n麻姑向我笑，手挽双髻鬟。\n白玉饰姣貌，丹砂驻酡颜。\n言写《黄庭经》，仍归青要山。\n从君采芝术，白云非人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26883,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"述书","author":"沈彩","text":"不知春蚓与秋蛇，嫡嗣山阴第一家。\n曾彷金钗为转折，谁云花骨有欹斜。\n焚书空复嗟秦始，炼石应须问女娲。\n淳古自难清劲易，十年辛苦悔涂鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26884,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚景独坐遣怀","author":"沈彩","text":"钩帘暝色下松杉，独倚阑干絮语喃。\n薄醉懒添螺子黛，嫩寒初试杏花衫。\n法书大半从人弆，诗草无多且自芟。\n故事欲查镫未上，好教明月照开函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26885,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题自写兰","author":"沈彩","text":"入春十日雨兼风，兰叶香迟未破丛。\n差喜砚田初解冻，墨花争发翠毫中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26886,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有日本人索余书戏作","author":"沈彩","text":"簪花妙格几曾悭，万里鲸波到海山。\n不似唐宫一片叶，只随沟水向人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26887,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卧病","author":"姚世鉴","text":"卧病逾时岁又新，衡门两版绝嚣尘。\n垂帘怕放东风入，春到贫家不当春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26888,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"楼居偶成","author":"张粲","text":"一竿晴旭上帘钩，点点寒山翠入楼。\n多病懒裁鹦鹉赋，薄寒初御鹔鹴裘。\n香浮竹叶杯中影，声彻梅花笛里秋。\n平楚苍茫惊欲雪，澹烟如织迥生愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26889,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中立秋","author":"张粲","text":"金井梧桐坠，轻寒渐中人。\n妾心如落叶，回首惜青春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26890,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"信至","author":"张粲","text":"门前綦履迹，閤外笑谈声。\n怪得银釭里，镫花夜夜生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26891,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕怀武林诸姊妹","author":"张粲","text":"乌鹊桥边夜渡秋，穿针记共上高楼。\n那知万里银河水，泻入南天尽是愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26892,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对镜忆冰绡姊","author":"张粲","text":"昔年誊绣对青江，倚槛回看玉一双。\n今日镜中惟瘦影，含情不忍向寒窗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26893,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻邻家抚筝","author":"张粲","text":"谁家银甲弄春阴，弦上深情指下生。\n弹到断肠浑不住，应怜漂泊在京城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"张粲","text":"春事阑珊镇日阴，客中消息断肠吟，妾心正似桥头柳，不遇东风恨不深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"弄箫","author":"张粲","text":"小栏閒品玉参差，偷眼娇花绽几枝。\n曲罢巡檐聊骋望，秦楼烟雨正迷离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦秦淮别业","author":"张粲","text":"曾登快阁看娇红，转眼春光入梦中。\n安得翩跹同燕子，随风吹过大江东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西泠閒咏","author":"王炜","text":"澄江回抱古城斜，一片烟云接永嘉。\n为爱好山聊驻足，偶依高树便成家。\n湖光潋滟侵行笈，竹影参差带落花。\n闻道故人将卜隐，短衣双挽鹿门车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗","author":"吕坤德","text":"茫茫弱水隔丹丘，罗袜缁尘感去留。\n识字更添今日障，散花恐惹后人愁。\n静观冰雪心源澈，得卧烟霞世味休。\n一任山光来比并，撩人眉黛拂城头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒山","author":"汪瑶","text":"飞雨过群岭，篮舆陟翠微。\n幽径入松际，轻风吹人衣。\n高士有遗迹，想见疏凿时。\n老屋就深树，寒泉泻平池。\n墓梅双虬龙，屈铁盘高枝。\n缅怀硕人轴，偕隐赋乐饥。\n已辞梁栋材，自远太庙牺。\n一门擅文藻，渊雅良可师。\n予亦慕高隐，愿采商山芝。\n鹿门期可遂，怀古生遐思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得月如弓","author":"顾有容","text":"新月盈盈挂晚晴，人从小院忆边情。\n长空射处旄头落，好卜滇池奏太平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋竹","author":"顾有容","text":"凉露娟娟引晚风，幽篁筛影月明中。\n窗前一样萧萧响，添却秋声更不同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明妃怨","author":"王筠","text":"紫台风急雁声愁，去国离家不自由。\n独有穹庐深夜月，清光不异汉宫秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆远吟","author":"史筠","text":"车马行时春之初，梧桐叶落秋何如。\n凄凉憔悴空闺里，珠箔垂垂独自居。\n忽逢云外秋归雁，一纸家书如觌面。\n感君念妾意缠绵，濯指开针肠欲断。\n问君毕竟几时还，妾已愁消红粉颜。\n几回梦绕关山道，相思不断如连环。\n相思相思无处说，卷帘诉与天边月。\n明月已圆人未圆，素辉偏照孤帷前。\n商飙萧瑟寒机动，蟋蟀声中愁不眠。\n小鬟梦呓呼不醒，起来自拨残镫影。\n窗前恨煞长鸣鸡，一声啼起霜天冷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中述怀","author":"史筠","text":"病为愁侵无计舒，那堪一卧两旬馀。\n自来自去窗前月，相近相亲架上书。\n奢望肯随梅冷淡，病躯却似竹空虚。\n倩人扶起临青镜，旧日形容竟不如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋后春晖归家口占","author":"史筠","text":"游子还家乍解鞍，慈帏侍奉已承欢。\n归期虽负中秋约，兰桂庭前月未残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答外子渡太湖寄诗","author":"周瑶","text":"已闻黄叶下秋波，两地离愁谁较多。\n愿得曲湖归赐日，为君亲手织渔蓑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26907,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋琴","author":"王瑶湘","text":"美人秋札至，贻我金徽琴。\n一鼓离鸾曲，谁人知此音。\n寒霜谱哀调，淡月洗孤心。\n何事王孙女，千秋遗恨深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟送别","author":"王瑶湘","text":"孤舟暮归去，别路江南树。\n烟外有钟声，故人在何处？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谢别观察夫人","author":"许飞云","text":"自怜生薄命，荆布一蛾眉。\n何意云天谊，深承礼数知。\n别时增缱绻，归日更支离。\n回首秦淮水，悠悠寄梦思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶中丹桂","author":"许飞云","text":"西风萧瑟透芸窗，金粟凝香吐嫩黄。\n祇恐秋光易凋绝，胆瓶深护一枝芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花 其一","author":"商采","text":"走马回塘细草齐，有情常自逐春蹄。\n且教天上看成雪，敢恨人间踏作泥。\n红板几条村径杳，青烟一片酒旗低。\n纷纷蜂蝶还无数，翠阁朱楼路已迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花 其二","author":"商采","text":"淡抹斜阳欲暮时，看花犹是惜归迟。\n馀香不信全消日，瘦影重疑未放枝。\n草满长堤成远望，山围故国剩相思。\n清尊短拍年年事，肠断深闺祇自知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其一","author":"商采","text":"万里长云暗节旄，天山秋尽雁飞高。\n风吹塞马霜蹄疾，雪扑征衣冻宝刀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其二","author":"商采","text":"角弓白羽挂雕鞍，醉卧河阳铁甲寒。\n烽火夜来知有敌，一时齐向月中看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放言","author":"钱聚瀛","text":"白云出没山之巅，中有仙客如枯禅。\n眸子炯炯衣蹁跹，粲然启齿呼我前。\n我憎凡俗再稽首，仙人隔云更招手。\n呼尔来，勿尔咎，海边明月难常圆，仙子岂无尘中缘。\n今来适尔谪数满，携尔且住沧海边。\n充肠鱼肉应厌饫，药苗芝草常新鲜。\n人间浊酒那可饮，何如山中一勺飞来泉？\n荆山之鼎，紫金之丹，授尔宝诀能延年。\n丹成服食皆神仙，翻然驾鹤冲高天。\n不知天阙近，但觉天风寒。\n两行天乐遥相引，调笙握管乘青鸾。\n下窥尘世在何所，黄云白雾交漫漫。\n下臣有一语，愿得上帝然。\n不作朱门之贵客，愿作蓬莱之云烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀陆费季斋表姊 其一","author":"钱聚瀛","text":"重逢应有喜，何事转生悲。\n我已愁如许，君今鬓有丝。\n纵图良晤久，先恨别离时。\n拟卜墙东舍，终身共咏诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀陆费季斋表姊 其二","author":"钱聚瀛","text":"忆昔联床夜，相携意最殷。\n更阑频剪烛，兴到总论文。\n落拓谁怜我，知心独有君。\n莫嫌书札杳，操纸思缤纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"集近水楼居分韵得鹊字","author":"金孝维","text":"居閒客过稀，门巷喧晴鹊。\n幽人共相访，不负前期约。\n命婢煮新茗，呼童整清酌。\n论文输封胡，礼法饶钟郝。\n谈笑杂琴书，善戏不为虐。\n佳会忘夜阑，从教凉月落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]